# Publish allowlist: keep local development and teaching files out of GitHub.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!INSTALL_SKILLS.ps1
!installable-skills/
!installable-skills/**
!assets/
!assets/images/
!assets/images/dt-sdlc-development-flow.svg
!assets/images/dt-sdlc-skill-purpose.svg
!assets/images/dt-sdlc-installation-flow.svg

# Never publish generated or sensitive content, including if later moved under an allowed path.
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.log
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.tmp
**/~$*
